                    "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1545127398-14699f92334b?w=800&h=600&fit=crop"
                ],
                description: "Experience premium sound quality with our wireless Bluetooth headphones. Features active noise cancellation, 30-hour battery life, and comfortable over-ear design. Perfect for music lovers and professionals alike."
            },
            {
